203:     // One hop per call, delegated to the trace machine: 4 hops in Stage 1
204:     // (emit, route, serve, render), 5 in Stage 2 (LB hop), 6 in Stage 3
205:     // (cache check + response emit), 7 in Stage 4 (database hop), 8 in
